// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// ===================  Special Edition Skins  =========================
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

// A unique that drops with an alternate skin has stat 270 (item_shiny_appearance). The game itself writes the orange
// "5th Anniversary Edition" only on Season 12's five (stat 270 = 5: Shaftstop, Harlequin Crest, Stormshield, Mang
// Song's Lesson, Fenris). Season 14's 18 have stat 270 = 1 and no line of their own: Chance Guards, Ribcracker,
// Buriza-Do Kyanon, The Spirit Shroud, Guardian Angel, Venom Grip, War Traveler, String of Ears, Hellslayer, The
// Grandfather, Stormspire, Herald of Zakarum, Fleshripper, Medusa's Gaze, Ormus' Robes, Giant Skull, Earth Shifter
// and Head Hunter's Glory. They get the same line, the last one under every highlight, so it sits right above
// Corrupted (the author, 2026-11-01)
ItemDisplay[UNI STAT270=1]:%NAME%{%ORANGE%5th Anniversary Edition%CL%%NAME%}%CONTINUE%
